# Keep LF line endings in the working tree on every OS. Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would check text files out as CRLF -
# Prettier (endOfLine: lf) would then flag every file it touches, and diffs
# would fill with line-ending noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
